[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:59. Is That All]
[00:00.660]Lesson 59. | 第59课。
[00:02.715]I want some envelopes, please. | 请给我一些信封。
[00:05.910]Do you want the large size or the small size? | 您要大号的还是小号的？
[00:09.645]The large size, please. | 请给我大号的。
[00:12.645]Have you any writing paper? | 你们有信纸吗？
[00:15.690]Yes, we have. | 是的，我们有。
[00:18.115]I haven't any small pads; I only have large ones. | 我没有小记事本；我只有大记事本。
[00:23.530]Do you want a pad? | 您要一个记事本吗？
[00:25.335]Yes, please. | 是的，请给我一个。
[00:27.350]And I want some black ink and some glue. | 我还要一些黑墨水和一些胶水。
[00:31.645]A bottle of ink and a bottle of glue. | 一瓶墨水和一瓶胶水。
[00:35.320]And I want a large box of chalk, too. | 我还要一大盒粉笔。
[00:40.135]I only have small boxes. | 我只有小盒子。
[00:42.925]Do you want one? | 您要一个吗？
[00:44.620]No, thank you. | 不，谢谢。
[00:46.800]Is that all? | 就这些了吗？
[00:48.910]That's all, thank you. | 就这些了，谢谢。
[00:51.660]What else do you want? | 您还要什么？
[00:54.760]I want my change. | 我要我的零钱。